<div>
<p class="cmp-p">If you're outfitting a soccer team in the US in 2026, the realistic choices for fully custom jerseys aren't Nike or Adidas &mdash; they're specialist makers that design and produce to order. This page compares four of the strongest for custom soccer kits: <strong>MOMUTO</strong>, <strong>Icarus FC</strong>, <strong>spized</strong>, and <strong>owayo</strong>. Each leads on something different &mdash; price, creativity, speed, or heritage &mdash; so the right pick depends on what your team values most.</p>
<p class="cmp-p"><strong>A note on terms:</strong> "soccer" and "football" are the same sport; these makers all produce the same custom jersey, shorts, and uniform whichever word you use. MOMUTO publishes this comparison, so treat our self-assessment with appropriate skepticism &mdash; the competitor figures below come from each brand's own 2026 sources.</p>
